{
  "key": 13342,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Why?\n",
        "Why did I lose?\r",
        "I never made any mistakes raising\n",
        "my Pokémon…\r",
        "Darn it! You’re the new Pokémon\n",
        "League Champion!\r",
        "Although I don’t like to admit it…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayer",
      "en_US": "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayerComeWithMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "You understand that your victory\n",
        "was not just your own doing.\r",
        "The bond you share with your\n",
        "Pokémon is marvelous.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "Come with me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_GymFinale_Text_OakWait",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! {STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}!\n",
        "Wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_GymFinale_Text_OakMadeIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Phew… I made it in time!\r",
        "Look at you two. You both made it\n",
        "all the way to the top!\r",
        "Before you start, let me heal your\n",
        "Pokémon. I want a fair fight!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_GymFinale_Text_PokemonHealed",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}’s Pokémon were\n",
        "fully healed!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_GymFinale_Text_OakThisBattleDecides",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: This battle decides two\n",
        "things.\r",
        "The winner becomes the Pokémon\n",
        "League Champion…\r",
        "…and the Leader of the new\n",
        "Pallet Town Gym!\r",
        "Now, show me everything you’ve\n",
        "learned!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "I was looking forward to seeing\n",
        "you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "My rival should be strong to keep\n",
        "me sharp.\r",
        "While working on my Pokédex, I\n",
        "looked all over for Pokémon.\r",
        "Not only that, I assembled teams\n",
        "that would beat any Pokémon type.\r",
        "And now…\r",
        "I’m the Pokémon League Champion!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "Do you know what that means?\r",
        "I’ll tell you.\r",
        "I am the most powerful Trainer in\n",
        "the world!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "You came back, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "Hahah, that is so great!\r",
        "My rival should be strong to keep\n",
        "me sharp.\r",
        "While working on my Pokédex, I\n",
        "looked all over for Pokémon.\r",
        "Not only that, I assembled teams\n",
        "that would beat any Pokémon type.\r",
        "And now…\r",
        "I’m the Pokémon League Champion!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "Do you know what that means?\r",
        "I’ll tell you.\r",
        "I am the most powerful Trainer in\n",
        "the world!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_GymFinale_Text_OakCongratulations",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "You did it! You really did it!\r",
        "The new Champion of the Pokémon\n",
        "League… from little Pallet Town!\r",
        "I’ve watched Trainers climb this\n",
        "mountain for fifty years.\r",
        "Not one of them did it with a\n",
        "single type, start to finish!\r",
        "And that means one thing more…\r",
        "The Pallet Town Gym is yours,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Its very first Leader!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: So, you’ve won!\n",
        "Sincerely, congratulations!\r",
        "You’re the new Pokémon League\n",
        "Champion!\r",
        "You’ve grown up so much since you\n",
        "first left with {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} to work\f",
        "on the Pokédex.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, you have come of age!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_GymFinale_Text_OakToRival",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}…\r",
        "You fought well. But you forgot to\n",
        "treat your Pokémon with love and\f",
        "trust.\r",
        "A Gym Leader has to earn that\n",
        "trust every single day.\r",
        "Think about that before you\n",
        "challenge {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}’s Gym!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakImDisappointedRival",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}…\n",
        "I’m disappointed in you.\r",
        "I came when I heard you’d beaten\n",
        "the Elite Four.\r",
        "But, when I got here, you had\n",
        "already lost!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, do you understand why\n",
        "you lost?\r",
        "You have forgotten to treat your\n",
        "Pokémon with love and trust.\r",
        "Without them, you will never\n",
        "become a Champ again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_GymFinale_Text_OakSeeYouAtTheCeremony",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Now, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. The League wants\n",
        "to make it official.\r",
        "They’re throwing an opening\n",
        "ceremony for your Gym, back home\f",
        "in Pallet Town!\r",
        "Half the town will be there. Your\n",
        "mother’s probably baking already!\r",
        "Go on ahead. I’ll…\r",
        "…I’ll see you there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0527_T10R0601_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
